<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?>
<MessageStudioText
	Format="1.2" xmlns="nintendo:msgstudio">
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r04w_stop_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おい！　トレーナー▼
いつのまにやら　あんなに
いわが　ならんでいてな……▼
しかも　ひでんの　かいりきを
つかっても　おせないぞい……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T12:44:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T09:18:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>おい！　トレーナー▼
いつのまにやら　あんなに
岩が　並んでいてな……▼
しかも　秘伝の　かいりきを
使っても　押せないぞい……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T12:44:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T09:18:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：White2ver
・ここでのアクロマとの戦闘前
※アクロマ戦闘時は消去</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T06:23:05" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>WORKMAN</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T09:18:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-08T05:47:34" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r04w_stop_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まさか　ポケモンの
イワパレス　だったとは……▼
イワパレスなら　このさきの　さばく
リゾートデザートに　いるぞい！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-17T03:24:28" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T09:18:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>まさか　ポケモンの
イワパレス　だったとは……▼
イワパレスなら　この先の　砂漠
リゾートデザートに　いるぞい！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-17T03:24:28" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T09:18:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：White2ver
・アクロマとの戦闘語</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T06:23:06" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>WORKMAN</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T09:18:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-08T05:47:34" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r04w_rock_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おおきな　いわ　だけど……
どうしてだか　かいりきで　おせない！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T09:18:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T09:18:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>大きな　岩だけど……
どうしてだか　かいりきで　押せない！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T09:18:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T09:18:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ポケモン
・道幅分並べる
・調べたとき
・鳴き声処理は不要</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T09:18:17" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>大きな岩
イワパレス</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T09:18:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-08T05:47:34" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r04w_swboss_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>アクロマ『まってましたよ！▼
どうしました？
うしろが　きになりますか？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T09:18:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T09:18:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アクロマ『待ってましたよ！▼
どうしました？
後ろが　気になりますか？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T09:18:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T09:18:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：White2ver
・c03p01でのイベント後に出現
・続けてswboss_03</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T06:23:07" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWBOSS
アクロマ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T09:18:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-08T05:47:34" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r04w_swboss_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>これは　いわ　ではなく
イワパレス　という　ポケモンです▼
みていてください▼
わたしが　つくった　ポケモンを
かっせいか　させる　どうぐで……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T09:18:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T09:18:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>これは　岩ではなく
イワパレス　という　ポケモンです▼
みていてください▼
わたしが　造った　ポケモンを
活性化させる　装置で……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T09:18:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T09:18:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：White2ver
・メッセージ表示後、イワパレスに向かう
・アクロマと正対した岩の動作モデルが
　イワパレスに置き換わる
・続けてswboss_03</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T06:23:09" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWBOSS
アクロマ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T09:18:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-08T05:47:34" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r04w_rock_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ぱれっしゅ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-12T04:26:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T09:18:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ぱれっしゅ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-12T04:26:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T09:18:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>イワパレス
・どれでも同じ
・メッセージ表示後、野生ポケモンとの戦闘に
・どれか一匹と戦闘すると
　フィールド復帰時、他の動作モデルも削除</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-12T04:26:11" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>大きな岩
イワパレス</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-12T04:26:11" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-08T05:47:34" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
